<title>FRANCE: EP approves draft directive on workers' rights.</title>
<headline>EP approves draft directive on workers' rights.</headline>
<dateline>STRASBOURG 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Parliament approved on Thursday a proposal designed to ensure workers throughout the European Union are given similar rights to protection in the event of a takeover.</p>
<p>Parliament introduced several amendments which strengthen the draft directive, COM(94)300.</p>
</text>
